Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 05:34:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/33] plugin: add descriptor generation support

Add support for generating plugin descriptors from
plugin request information.

Extend the plugin factory interface with descriptor generation
support and add plugin registry helpers for invoking descriptor
generation through registered plugin factories.

Plugin-specific descriptor generation remains owned by individual
plugin factories, allowing plugin metadata interpretation to remain
local to each plugin and avoiding plugin-specific logic in
framework consumers.

This change establishes the plugin request to descriptor generation
flow used by future plugin request handling and event extension
integration.

Add unit tests covering descriptor generation through registered
plugin factories.

No functional behavior changes are intended.

Change-Id: Ifcd747054834914da3ba087afed34570120f6966
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
---
 plugin/plugin_factory.hpp            | 14 ++++++++
 plugin/plugin_registry.cpp           | 14 ++++++++
